  "description": "A WPF-specific NuGet package providing window management services, dialog and notification helpers, region (tab-based area) management, and an overlay loading indicator (adorner) for MVVM applications. Uses a factory-based configuration pattern — map ViewModel types to views and let the services handle creation, ownership, and lifecycle. The loading indicator is driven by a single attached property bound to a view model flag. Designed for .NET Framework 4.8 with WPF. No external NuGet dependencies.",
